      <header-image url="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/sitesv/AA5AbUBmn3oCvA68PzT5xbJ6hnWKG2mDjhoBraQwvCOHV7rN5t-eiB4l0L_dLCi4B3b7BSoLIK_hM-AkVqrYm6gNSKDfb4qU-oL3OZ0Q_uIBh-TAAWZSXBPSPzfi8LupfcHNF3bbJEEyiEt2KXmlxonZfpyIK5vNXPYgJE3VHa3GDEf1onOF3iL41GHS5hM=w16383"/>
      <venue-line>9th - 11th of February 2026 @ <link href="https://philosophy.sas.ac.uk/">Institute of Philosophy</link></venue-line>
      <title>6th Symposium on Proof-theoretic Semantics</title>
      <organizer-line>Organizers <link href="https://www.alexandergheorghiu.com/">Alexander V. Gheorghiu</link> and <link href="https://sites.google.com/view/tao-gu/about">Tao Gu</link>.</organizer-line>
    </section>

    <section id="about" type="content">
      <image url="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/sitesv/AA5AbUAv0qSdXNHQipIr-RtxfMuRibIPLaZawxjrqSh-BOmMbkMfcRhyY0HPDifwDcCXbQ7ZEgSC3POWNcdj6OLC6I81VLc_ciWYxmEZcNAWJs8VmOaFbMVHo_tiGC7e2RMChMBA9UxuP3BHuyt2QSqDNLfTMNCd6JUbTpzzQYc6ULc0bRE-KkIFsGxb2CGrqAfNJryM7Pxz68LFz009vce3ey4QVWFHKqAju5LabCY=w1280"
             caption="3rd Symposium on Proof-theoretic Semantics @ The International Conference on Automated Reasoning with Analytic Tableaux and Related Methods — TABLEAUX 2023"/>
      <heading>A workshop spread across three days on current research on proof-theoretic semantics.</heading>
      <p>Presentations will be a <strong>total of one hour</strong> including questions and discussion.</p>
      <p>The event is hosted by the <link href="https://philosophy.sas.ac.uk/centres-partnerships/celli">Centre for Logic, Language, and Information</link> (CeLLI), <link href="https://philosophy.sas.ac.uk/">Institute of Philosophy</link> (IoP) at the <link href="https://www.sas.ac.uk/">School of Advanced Study</link> (SAS).</p>
    </section>

    <section id="topics" type="content">
      <heading>Topics</heading>
      <list>
        <item>soundness &amp; completeness</item>
        <item>classical, intuitionistic, modal, substructural logic</item>
        <item>applications and interpretations</item>
        <item>philosophical considerations</item>
        <item>logical inferentialism</item>
        <item>meta-theory</item>
        <item>...anything proof-theoretic semantics.</item>
      </list>
    </section>

